# The Go build context is the repository root. OLD/ is the archived Node app,
# kept only as a rollback target, so it is excluded to keep the build context
# small — nothing in the Go image needs it.
#
# The Node image is built with OLD/ as its own context and uses OLD/.dockerignore.
OLD
node_modules
dev-config
dev-data
dev-config-gen.js
config
data
.git
templates
ca_profile.xml
*.md
docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile.node
docker-entrypoint.sh
scripts
docs